<%--
Sie_Bad_Parent - a parent template that throws while rendering.

this.data.sie_missing is undefined, so reading .deep off it is a TypeError raised from
INSIDE the parent's render function - exactly the shape of a real defect in a parent's
markup.
--%>
<Define:Sie_Bad_Parent class="sie-bad-parent">
  <div><%= this.data.sie_missing.deep %></div>
  <div class="sie-slot"><%= content('body') %></div>
</Define:Sie_Bad_Parent>
